{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "09350992-9060-8117-be28-d564c4dc0321",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:46:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Angela H. Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:42:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:43:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon Kevin. My name is Angela Grasso. I am calling because there is a big limb hanging over the sidewalk, and I am a little worried somebody will get hurt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:43:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Yeah, let's get that taken care of. Where's the limb, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:43:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 111 Narragansett Avenue. In the Fifth Ward. I am the neighbor, I live next door, but the tree is in front of that house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:43:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 111 Narragansett. And did this come down in the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:43:35-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, after the nor'easter, Friday and Saturday, two days ago. The wind was very strong. The limb broke but it did not fall all the way. It is still hanging, like, held by a little piece, and it is right over where people walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:43:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's partly down, hanging low over the sidewalk. Is it touching any wires, that you can see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:43:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I do not think so. The wires are on the other side, by the street. But I am not sure, it is high. I do not want to go close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:44:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, good, don't go near it. Stay off it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:44:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I want to ask you directly, who do I call for this? Where do I report a downed tree? Is it the city, or the owner of the house, or the electric company? I do not know who takes this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:44:28-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair question, it depends a little. If it's a city tree, out on the street side, that's us, and I can put in a request right now. If it's on private property, the owner is usually the one who has to deal with it, even if it's hanging over the sidewalk. And if it's on or near the power lines, that's the utility."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:44:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. And how do I know if it is a city tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:44:54-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, a crew has to look at it. Usually if it's in that strip between the sidewalk and the road, it's the city's. If it's back toward the house, it's the owner's. Tell you what, I'll write it up as a hazard over the sidewalk and have somebody go out and check it. They'll figure out whose it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:45:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that would be wonderful, thank you. I was afraid you would say it is not your problem and I would go around in circles."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:45:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nah, we'll look. Crews are pretty busy after a storm like that, so I can't tell you the exact hour, but a limb over a sidewalk goes toward the top of the list. Can I get a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:45:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is 401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:45:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-six-three, perfect. And it's Angela Grasso, G-R-A-S-S-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:45:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, two S, correct. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:45:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's a hanging limb over the sidewalk at 111 Narragansett Avenue, from the storm, neighbor calling, no wires that you can tell. Anything else about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:45:57-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only that the people walk there every day, with the children, with the dogs. And now with Christmas coming, more people. The holidays, they sneak up on us every year, you know? One day it is Thanksgiving and then suddenly it is December and everybody is busy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:46:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They sure do. I'm still not ready myself. Okay, I've got it entered. If anyone from the crew needs more, they'll call you at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:46:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. You have been very kind. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:46:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Angela. Take care."
    }
  ],
